  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252falacrity-easy-anvils-easy-magic-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alacrity-easy-anvils-easy-magic-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>這是一個<strong>非官方的相容套件</strong>，旨在將<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Anvils</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Magic</a> 模組的美學風格與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alacrity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alacrity</a> 資源包保持一致。此套件已<strong>100% 完成</strong>，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Easy Anvils</strong>：支援「編輯命名牌」圖形使用者介面（GUI）</li>\n<li><strong>Easy Magic</strong>：支援「附魔桌重新擲骰」圖形使用者介面（GUI）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Anvils</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Magic</a> 兩者皆是<strong>選填項目</strong>。僅安裝其中任一項即可。</li>\n<li>為了獲得最佳體驗，建議搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/alacrity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alacrity</a> 使用本資源包。</li>\n<li>如有錯誤回報或建議，請在 <strong>Discord (@thedatthai)</strong> 上私訊我。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>感謝：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/satellence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satellence</a> - Alacrity 的創建者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fuzs</a> - Easy Anvils 與 Easy Magic 的創建者</li>\n</ul>",
